Emoji artwork in this directory is from Twemoji
copyright Twitter, Inc and other contributors,
licensed under CC-BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jdecked/twemoji/refs/heads/main/assets/72x72/<codepoint>.png

These PNGs are build inputs only: mkemoji.c downsamples and palette-quantizes
them into the emoji of font0.bfnt .. font7.bfnt, which are a modified (derived) form of that artwork.
Anything distributing font*.bfnt or binaries using it should carry this credit.

Regenerate:  make -C _font install     (builds the fonts first; mkemoji reads the cell size of its size)
